## Key Concepts
- Private Endpoints and DENY public access for storage/sql
- User-Assigned Managed Identities for service-to-resource access
- Azure Policy to enforce private endpoints and deny public exposure
- Canary rollout and quick rollback plan with policy reversion

## Code Example
